Derived work:

main.js, model.js and ops.js started as a copy of the "files" mod (version 0.1.15) that ships
with herdr-app (mod.json "cloned_from"). The listing script approach, the Windows PowerShell
listing, the git status marks and the follow-the-focused-pane location logic come from it.
Herdr is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy is in LICENSE-APACHE.
Those parts remain under that license.
Changes: Material icons, pin/unfollow, props.folder, opening in drover-viewer, the right-click
menu (system app, reveal, copy paths, new file/folder, rename, Move to Trash), the hide toggle,
the quick filter, credential locks, keyboard navigation, dimming of git-ignored entries.

